{"seq":2,"slug":"reconciliation","title":"协调算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/reconciliation","wordCount":923,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"协调算法\">协调算法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>协调（Reconciliation）是 React 比较新旧虚拟 DOM 树、计算出最小变更集并应用到真实 DOM 的过程。通用树 diff 的时间复杂度为 O(n³)，React 依靠「类型相同的元素产生相同的树」与「key 标识子元素稳定性」两条启发式假设把它降到 O(n)。本章围绕这两条假设展开：单节点与多节点 Diff 策略、key 的正确用法、跳过无变化子树的 Bailout 优化，以及元素类型变化带来的子树销毁与重建。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么是协调\">什么是协调</h2><p><strong>协调（Reconciliation）</strong> 是 React 比较新旧两棵虚拟 DOM 树，计算出最小变更集并应用到真实 DOM 的过程。由于通用树 diff 算法的时间复杂度为 O(n³)，React 基于两个启发式假设将复杂度降至 <strong>O(n)</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>不同类型的元素会产生不同的树</li>\n<li>通过 <code>key</code> 属性标识哪些子元素在不同渲染间是稳定的</li>\n</ol>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[触发更新] --&gt; B[生成新的 React Element 树]&#10;    B --&gt; C[与 current Fiber 树逐层对比]&#10;    C --&gt; D{元素类型是否相同?}&#10;    D -- 相同 --&gt; E[复用 Fiber 节点, 更新 props]&#10;    D -- 不同 --&gt; F[销毁旧子树, 创建新子树]&#10;    E --&gt; G[递归处理子节点]&#10;    F --&gt; G&#10;    G --&gt; H[标记 Effect flags]&#10;    H --&gt; I[Commit 阶段应用变更]\">flowchart TD\n    A[触发更新] --&gt; B[生成新的 React Element 树]\n    B --&gt; C[与 current Fiber 树逐层对比]\n    C --&gt; D{元素类型是否相同?}\n    D -- 相同 --&gt; E[复用 Fiber 节点, 更新 props]\n    D -- 不同 --&gt; F[销毁旧子树, 创建新子树]\n    E --&gt; G[递归处理子节点]\n    F --&gt; G\n    G --&gt; H[标记 Effect flags]\n    H --&gt; I[Commit 阶段应用变更]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"diffing-策略\">Diffing 策略</h2><h3 id=\"单节点-diff\">单节点 Diff</h3><p>当新的 JSX 只有一个子元素时，React 遍历旧的子 Fiber 链表，寻找 <code>key</code> 和 <code>type</code> 都匹配的节点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function reconcileSingleElement(&#10;  returnFiber: FiberNode,&#10;  currentFirstChild: FiberNode | null,&#10;  element: ReactElement,&#10;): FiberNode {&#10;  const key = element.key;&#10;  let child = currentFirstChild;&#10;&#10;  while (child !== null) {&#10;    if (child.key === key) {&#10;      if (child.type === element.type) {&#10;        deleteRemainingChildren(returnFiber, child.sibling);&#10;        const existing = useFiber(child, element.props);&#10;        existing.return = returnFiber;&#10;        return existing;&#10;      }&#10;      deleteRemainingChildren(returnFiber, child);&#10;      break;&#10;    } else {&#10;      deleteChild(returnFiber, child);&#10;    }&#10;    child = child.sibling;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const created = createFiberFromElement(element);&#10;  created.return = returnFiber;&#10;  return created;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reconcileSingleElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  returnFiber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentFirstChild</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  element</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReactElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.key;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentFirstChild;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (child.key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> key) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (child.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> element.type) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        deleteRemainingChildren</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(returnFiber, child.sibling);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> existing</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useFiber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(child, element.props);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        existing.return </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> returnFiber;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> existing;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      deleteRemainingChildren</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(returnFiber, child);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      break</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      deleteChild</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(returnFiber, child);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> child.sibling;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> created</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createFiberFromElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(element);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created.return </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> returnFiber;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>key 匹配</th>\n<th>type 匹配</th>\n<th>结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全匹配</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>复用节点，更新 props</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>key 相同 type 不同</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>删除所有旧节点，创建新节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>key 不同</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>标记该旧节点删除，继续遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"多节点-diff\">多节点 Diff</h3><p>当子元素为数组时，React 使用两轮遍历策略：</p>\n<p><strong>第一轮：</strong> 从左到右逐个比较新旧节点，处理更新的情况。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function reconcileChildrenArray(&#10;  returnFiber: FiberNode,&#10;  currentFirstChild: FiberNode | null,&#10;  newChildren: ReactElement[],&#10;): FiberNode | null {&#10;  let oldFiber = currentFirstChild;&#10;  let newIdx = 0;&#10;  let lastPlacedIndex = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (; oldFiber !== null &amp;&amp; newIdx &lt; newChildren.length; newIdx++) {&#10;    if (oldFiber.index &gt; newIdx) {&#10;      break;&#10;    }&#10;    const newFiber = updateSlot(returnFiber, oldFiber, newChildren[newIdx]);&#10;    if (newFiber === null) break;&#10;    lastPlacedIndex = placeChild(newFiber, lastPlacedIndex, newIdx);&#10;    oldFiber = oldFiber.sibling;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 第二轮处理剩余节点...&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> reconcileChildrenArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  returnFiber</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  currentFirstChild</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  newChildren</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReactElement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"c